{
    "title": "2nd Line - Second Phone Number",
    "description": "Get a second phone number to call and text! Keep your personal number private by using this 2nd phone number app! \r\n\r\nProtect Your Privacy With 2ndLine\r\nYour phone number is likely connected to numerous online accounts. Protect your privacy by using a second phone number for non-personal activities. Whether you're buying or selling items online, job hunting, or dating, 2nd Line provides a convenient solution.\r\n\r\nSeparate Work And Personal Life\r\nWith a second local phone number, you can easily distinguish between work and personal calls. When you receive a call, you'll know whether it's related to work or personal matters.\r\n\r\nTexting And Calling Made Easy\r\n2nd Line allows text messaging and Wi-Fi calling. By adding a second phone number, you can more easily connect with your family, friends, or customers.\r\n\r\nCheaper Than Regular Calls\r\nPowered by its dedicated technology, 2nd Line makes phone calls, whether local or international, much cheaper than regular ones while maintaining high voice quality. It's just a few steps to create your dedicated second phone number.\r\n \r\nPowerful Features \r\n- Texts and Calls: Call and text to the US and Canada.\r\n- High-Quality Calls: Experience crystal-clear voice quality for seamless conversations.\r\n- Custom Voicemail: Record a personalized voicemail greeting.\r\n- Spam Call Blocking: Block unwanted spam calls permanently.\r\n- Call Forwarding: Easily forward calls to any number.\r\n- Call Recording: Record incoming and outgoing calls for reference.\r\n\r\nSubscription Terms\r\nPayment will be charged to your Google Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew at the end of each term unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period, and you will be charged the cost of renewal. Auto-renew can be turned off at any time from your Google account settings, but refunds will not be provided for the unused portion of the term.\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: http://2ndline.net/privacy.html\r\nDon't hesitate to try this second phone number app!\r\nIf you have any questions, please contact us at info@2ndline.net",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get a second phone number to call and text! Keep your personal number private by using this 2nd phone number app! <br><br>Protect Your Privacy With 2ndLine<br>Your phone number is likely connected to numerous online accounts. Protect your privacy by using a second phone number for non-personal activities. Whether you&#39;re buying or selling items online, job hunting, or dating, 2nd Line provides a convenient solution.<br><br>Separate Work And Personal Life<br>With a second local phone number, you can easily distinguish between work and personal calls. When you receive a call, you&#39;ll know whether it&#39;s related to work or personal matters.<br><br>Texting And Calling Made Easy<br>2nd Line allows text messaging and Wi-Fi calling. By adding a second phone number, you can more easily connect with your family, friends, or customers.<br><br>Cheaper Than Regular Calls<br>Powered by its dedicated technology, 2nd Line makes phone calls, whether local or international, much cheaper than regular ones while maintaining high voice quality. It&#39;s just a few steps to create your dedicated second phone number.<br> <br>Powerful Features <br>- Texts and Calls: Call and text to the US and Canada.<br>- High-Quality Calls: Experience crystal-clear voice quality for seamless conversations.<br>- Custom Voicemail: Record a personalized voicemail greeting.<br>- Spam Call Blocking: Block unwanted spam calls permanently.<br>- Call Forwarding: Easily forward calls to any number.<br>- Call Recording: Record incoming and outgoing calls for reference.<br><br>Subscription Terms<br>Payment will be charged to your Google Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew at the end of each term unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period, and you will be charged the cost of renewal. Auto-renew can be turned off at any time from your Google account settings, but refunds will not be provided for the unused portion of the term.<br><br>Privacy policy: http://2ndline.net/privacy.html<br>Don&#39;t hesitate to try this second phone number app!<br>If you have any questions, please contact us at info@2ndline.net",
